    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Alex",
      "key": "firstVisit_BathHouse_MensLocker_memory_oneday",
      "field": null,
      "source": "I saw you checking out the bath house the other day. Trying to get in shape? Heh.#$e#Uh... you didn't go poking around in my locker, did you?$9",
      "translation": "Onehdy jsem tě viděl, jak se rozhlížíš po Lázeňském domě. Snažíš se dostat do formy? Hehe.#$e#Ehm... V mé skříňce se snad nikdo nehrabal, že ne?$9",
      "sourceSHA256": "b0999c4ca64de155c9dd0e39a13d73c1399b76cc35eb4b1799bf5f009b428fba",
      "translationSHA256": "5d16808bfd073ddfea4958ac4e338e3d735b50b87e6f8226b6dc90ec7626569d",
