    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Alex",
      "key": "Resort_Chair",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Aren't you hot in that outfit? C'mon, man... It's the beach!^Aren't you hot in that outfit? You gotta get some ocean breeze goin'!",
      "translation": "Není ti v tom oblečení horko? No tak, kámo... Jsme na pláži!^Není ti v tom oblečení horko? Musíš se trochu osvěžit mořským vánkem!",
      "sourceSHA256": "1dc11f51a6aa843fa052080d78070a29b4057ad9c6a894d3904e8cbf31de8bee",
      "translationSHA256": "a7e3c6fb773c346679106e8ea4e3bbb92a9959a72031557ab7c173b1059879ec",
